	<string>Codex-bangs captures the display under your pointer only when you click Look &amp; guide, sends it through Codex for guidance, and deletes the temporary image after the response.</string>
	<key>NSSpeechRecognitionUsageDescription</key>
	<string>Codex-bangs transcribes the voice question you explicitly record so you can review it before sending it to Codex.</string>
